cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Entropy meter: code and data for \"An entropy that does not vanish\""
abstract: >-
  A classroom Metropolis code turned into an entropy meter: the residual entropy of the
  triangular Ising antiferromagnet by thermodynamic integration of the energy from infinite
  temperature, with exact finite-lattice ground-state counts, the ferromagnet control, all
  simulation results and the scripts that make the paper's figures.
